# Healthy Life localization

When adding or changing any user-visible string in Healthy Life:

1. Add or update the key in `src/lib/healthy-life/i18n/messages/en.ts` (source of truth).
2. Update **every** locale file in `src/lib/healthy-life/i18n/messages/` for the same keys:
   `ru`, `ar`, `zh`, `fr`, `es`, `kk`, `ky`, `uz`, `ko`, `ja` (plus `en`).
3. Use `useT()` / `t("section.key")` in components — do not hardcode UI copy.
4. AI-facing text (advice prompts) must follow the selected app locale via `locale` query / `aiLanguage`.
5. Placeholders like `{pct}` / `{reason}` must stay identical across all locales.
6. Default language is English when the device language is unsupported; device language is preferred when supported.

Supported locales: en, ru, ar, zh, fr, es, kk, ky, uz, ko, ja (UN official + Kazakh, Kyrgyz, Uzbek, Korean, Japanese).
